 payment integration.','2026-10-28 02:48:02','2026-10-28 02:48:09'),(8,'sess_test_turn_1793137714','Visitor #3815',NULL,'127.0.0.1','Karachi, Pakistan (Local)','Unknown OS · Unknown Browser','/','bot','We have the logo ready and simple EasyPaisa is fine. Please send me the proposal and quote so we can proceed.','2026-10-28 02:48:34','2026-10-28 02:48:40');
