in Karachi, Pakistan | Amaanullah Khan','full-stack-developer-karachi','Karachi','Hire a senior full-stack developer in Karachi for custom CRM, SaaS platforms and business automation: Laravel backends, REST APIs, admin portals and Flutter mobile apps. On-site in Karachi, remote worldwide.','<div class=\"wrap\"><nav class=\"crumb\" aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\"><ol><li><a href=\"<?= base_url(\'/\') ?>\">Home</a></li><li aria-current=\"page\">Full-Stack Developer in Karachi</li></ol></nav></div>\n<section class=\"lhero\"><div class=\"wrap lhg\">\n <div>\n  <span class=\"bdg\">Full-Stack Developer · Karachi, Pakistan · Remote worldwide</span>\n  <h1>Hire a <em>Full-Stack Developer</em> in Karachi, Pakistan</h1><!-- DYNAMIC: $landing->h1 -->\n  <p class=\"sum\">Looking for a senior developer in Karachi for a <a class=\"il\" href=\"javascript:void(0)\">custom CRM</a><!-- DYNAMIC: internal link -> route() -->, SaaS platform or business automation system? I build production-grade Laravel backends, REST APIs, admin portals and workflow engines, and when your product also needs iOS and Android, I deliver Flutter mobile apps on the same Laravel API backend.</p>\n  <div class=\"hcta\"><a class=\"btn o\" href=\"<?= base_url(\'/contact\') ?>\">Start a consultation →</a><a class=\"btn gh\" href=\"https://wa.me/[NUMBER]\">WhatsApp now</a></div><!-- EDIT: WhatsApp number -->\n  <div class=\"hst\" style=\"--n:4\"><div><b>1.5M+</b><span>Leads in production CRM</span></div><div><b>4.8★</b><span>Google rating (27 reviews)</span></div><div><b>300+</b><span>Concurrent CRM users</span></div><div><b>5+</b><span>Years enterprise delivery</span></div></div><!-- DYNAMIC: $landing->stats[] (keep in sync with live figures) -->\n </div>\n <figure class=\"term v-layers\" aria-label=\"Full-Stack Software Development illustration\"><span class=\"sw\">SWAP: banner (optional)</span><div class=\"tb\"><i></i><i></i><i></i><em>One system, every layer</em></div><div class=\"lay\"><div class=\"ly\" style=\"--d:0.0s\"><span class=\"fi\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"7\" y=\"2\" width=\"10\" height=\"20\" rx=\"2.5\"/><path d=\"M11 18h2\"/></svg></span><div><b>Mobile</b><span>Flutter · iOS &amp; Android</span></div><i class=\"pk\" style=\"--d:0.0s\"></i></div><div class=\"ly\" style=\"--d:0.25s\"><span class=\"fi\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"3\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M3 9h18M9 21V9\"/></svg></span><div><b>Web</b><span>Blade · Vue.js</span></div><i class=\"pk\" style=\"--d:0.5s\"></i></div><div class=\"ly\" style=\"--d:0.5s\"><span class=\"fi\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m8 8-5 4 5 4M16 8l5 4-5 4M14 5l-4 14\"/></svg></span><div><b>API</b><span>Laravel REST · Sanctum</span></div><i class=\"pk\" style=\"--d:1.0s\"></i></div><div class=\"ly\" style=\"--d:0.75s\"><span class=\"fi\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><ellipse cx=\"12\" cy=\"5.5\" rx=\"8\" ry=\"3\"/><path d=\"M4 5.5v13c0 1.7 3.6 3 8 3s8-1.3 8-3v-13M4 12c0 1.7 3.6 3 8 3s8-1.3 8-3\"/></svg></span><div><b>Data</b><span>MySQL · Redis queues</span></div><i class=\"pk\" style=\"--d:1.5s\"></i></div></div><div class=\"area\"><span class=\"dot\"></span><b>Karachi, PK</b><span>PKT · UTC+5</span></div></figure>\n</div>\n<div class=\"cities\" aria-label=\"Areas served\"><span>Serving</span><b>Karachi</b><b>Pakistan</b><b>US</b><b>UK</b><b>UAE</b></div><!-- DYNAMIC: $landing->areas[] -->\n</section>\n<nav class=\"jump\" aria-label=\"On this page\"><div class=\"wrap\"><a href=\"#why\">Why dedicated</a><a href=\"#signs\">Signs</a><a href=\"#services\">Services</a><a href=\"#process\">Process</a><a href=\"#local\">Why Karachi</a><a href=\"#projects\">Projects</a><a href=\"#faq\">FAQ</a></div></nav>\n\n<section class=\"lsec rv \" id=\"why\" aria-labelledby=\"h-why\"><!-- DYNAMIC: $landing->sections[0] (split) -->\n <div class=\"lw\"><p class=\"eyb\"><span>01 · Why dedicated</span></p><h2 id=\"h-why\">Why Hire a Dedicated Senior Developer Instead of a Platform Freelancer</h2><div class=\"split\"><div><p class=lead>Fiverr and Upwork have thousands of developers listed from Karachi and across Pakistan; most are task-takers, not system thinkers. When you need a custom CRM that handles 1,000+ leads per day, a multi-tenant SaaS platform your clients pay monthly for, or an automation system that replaces five manual processes, you are not buying a gig. You are making an architectural decision that will shape your operations for the next three to five years.</p><p>I have shipped multi-tenant CRMs with 300+ concurrent users, payroll systems that process monthly cycles reliably, and enterprise ticketing portals that replaced email-chain chaos with auditable workflows. The difference shows in systems that still run cleanly twelve months after handover, not in the per-hour rate on a profile page.</p></div>\n <aside class=\"wbox\"><small>Full project ownership</small><ul class=\"pills\"><li>Requirements analysis</li><li>Database architecture</li><li>Weekly demos</li><li>Production deployment</li><li>Team documentation</li><li>Post-launch support</li></ul><p>A fundamentally different engagement than commissioning a task on a marketplace.</p></aside></div></div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"lsec rv dark\" id=\"signs\" aria-labelledby=\"h-signs\"><!-- DYNAMIC: $landing->sections[1] (signs) -->\n <div class=\"lw\"><p class=\"eyb\"><span>02 · Signs</span></p><h2 id=\"h-signs\">Signs Your Business Needs a Custom Software Developer</h2><p class=\"lead nar\">Most businesses reach the same breaking point at different speeds. If any of these sound familiar, off-the-shelf tools have hit their ceiling:</p>\n <div class=\"sit s3\"><div><span class=\"nn\">01</span><p>Your team manages leads, orders or operations in spreadsheets that break under volume.</p></div><div><span class=\"nn\">02</span><p>You pay per-seat licensing fees on a CRM that doesn’t match your actual sales process.</p></div><div><span class=\"nn\">03</span><p>Your developers spend more time working around your platform than building on it.</p></div><div><span class=\"nn\">04</span><p>Data is siloed across three or four tools with no single source of truth.</p></div><div><span class=\"nn\">05</span><p>Onboarding a new client or branch means manually replicating configurations.</p></div><div><span class=\"nn\">06</span><p>Reporting needs someone to export, merge and clean data every time management needs a number.</p></div></div>\n <div class=\"rep wide\"><b>The fix</b><p>Custom software built by a senior developer in Karachi addresses these at the architecture level, not with another tool on top: a system your team runs without a developer ticket for every report, that scales without a full rebuild when user counts double.</p></div>\n <div class=\"lnote\"><p>Read how custom software compares to SaaS tools: <a class=\"il\" href=\"javascript:void(0)\">custom software vs SaaS</a><!-- DYNAMIC: internal link -> route() -->.</p></div></div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"lsec rv \" id=\"services\" aria-labelledby=\"h-services\"><!-- DYNAMIC: $landing->sections[2] (cards) -->\n <div class=\"lw\"><p class=\"eyb\"><span>03 · Services</span></p><h2 id=\"h-services\">Software Development Services in Karachi &amp; Remotely</h2><p class=\"lead nar\">Whether you need a local Karachi partner for a startup product or a dedicated remote full-stack developer in Pakistan for an international platform, these are the core services I deliver for businesses that need more than a brochure website.</p>\n <div class=\"sgrid\"><article class=\"sv\"><span class=\"fi\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 5h18l-7 8v6l-4-2v-4z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"nn\">01</span><h3>Custom CRM &amp; ERP Systems</h3><p>Lead routing engines, pipeline stages, role-based dashboards, vendor management, approval workflows and operational reporting built around how your teams actually work. Not a Salesforce clone. See <a class=\"il\" href=\"<?= base_url(\'/crm-developers-pakistan\') ?>\">CRM developers in Pakistan</a><!-- DYNAMIC: route(\'landing.show\', \'crm\') -->.</p></article><article class=\"sv\"><span class=\"fi\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"3\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\" rx=\"2\"/><rect x=\"13\" y=\"3\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\" rx=\"2\"/><rect x=\"3\" y=\"13\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\" rx=\"2\"/><rect x=\"13\" y=\"13\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\" rx=\"2\"/></svg></span><span class=\"nn\">02</span><h3>SaaS Platform Development</h3><p>Multi-tenant architecture, subscription logic, admin panels and versioned API layers, so your product can onboard new clients, isolate their data and scale without rebuilding. See <a class=\"il\" href=\"javascript:void(0)\">SaaS &amp; web development</a><!-- DYNAMIC: internal link -> route() -->.</p></article><article class=\"sv\"><span class=\"fi\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"5\" cy=\"6\" r=\"2.5\"/><circle cx=\"19\" cy=\"18\" r=\"2.5\"/><path d=\"M7.5 6H14a4 4 0 0 1 0 8h-4a4 4 0 0 0 0 8\"/></svg></span><span class=\"nn\">03</span><h3>Business Process Automation</h3><p>Webhooks, scheduled jobs, approval chains and notification engines, so repetitive manual tasks run in the background. See <a class=\"il\" href=\"javascript:void(0)\">business process automation</a><!-- DYNAMIC: internal link -> route() -->.</p></article><article class=\"sv\"><span class=\"fi\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"6\" cy=\"12\" r=\"2.5\"/><circle cx=\"18\" cy=\"6\" r=\"2.5\"/><circle cx=\"18\" cy=\"18\" r=\"2.5\"/><path d=\"m8.2 11 7.6-4M8.2 13l7.6 4\"/></svg></span><span class=\"nn\">04</span><h3>REST API &amp; Integrations</h3><p>Documented JSON endpoints for mobile apps, partner systems and headless frontends, with Sanctum or Passport auth, validation and rate limiting. Integrations include payment gateways, SMS providers and third-party CRMs.</p></article><article class=\"sv\"><span class=\"fi\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"4\" width=\"18\" height=\"16\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M3 9h18M8 13h5M8 16h8\"/></svg></span><span class=\"nn\">05</span><h3>Admin Portals &amp; Internal Tools</h3><p>Secure dashboards with granular RBAC permissions, bulk actions, exports and audit history, so managers control data without waiting on developer tickets.</p></article><article class=\"sv\"><span class=\"fi\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 20V5M6 11l6-6 6 6\"/><path d=\"M4 20h16\"/></svg></span><span class=\"nn\">06</span><h3>Legacy System Modernization</h3><p>Upgrading aging PHP or Laravel codebases to PHP 8+, closing security gaps, fixing slow queries and restructuring for maintainability, without a full rewrite. See <a class=\"il\" href=\"<?= base_url(\'/laravel-developer-karachi\') ?>\">Laravel developer in Karachi</a><!-- DYNAMIC: route(\'landing.show\', \'laravel\') -->.</p></article><article class=\"sv\"><span class=\"fi\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"7\" y=\"2\" width=\"10\" height=\"20\" rx=\"2.5\"/><path d=\"M11 18h2\"/></svg></span><span class=\"nn\">07</span><h3>Mobile Apps (Flutter)</h3><p>Cross-platform iOS and Android apps in Flutter and Dart, connected to your Laravel REST API, with Firebase auth or push where needed. See <a class=\"il\" href=\"javascript:void(0)\">Flutter e-commerce app case study</a><!-- DYNAMIC: internal link -> route() --> · <a class=\"il\" href=\"javascript:void(0)\">real-time chat apps</a><!-- DYNAMIC: internal link -> route() -->.</p></article></div></div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"lsec rv \" id=\"industries\" aria-labelledby=\"h-industries\"><!-- DYNAMIC: $landing->sections[3] (industries) -->\n <div class=\"lw\"><p class=\"eyb\"><span>04 · Industries</span></p><h2 id=\"h-industries\">Industries I Build Software For</h2><p class=\"lead nar\">Custom software decisions are always domain-specific. Work across these verticals means I understand the data models, compliance pressures and workflow patterns before the first architecture call.</p>\n <div class=\"ind\"><div><span class=\"fi\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 11 12 4l9 7v9H3z\"/><path d=\"M9 20v-6h6v6\"/></svg></span><div><h3>Real Estate</h3><p>CRM portals, listing management, agent dashboards and lead attribution for high inquiry volume. See: <a class=\"il\" href=\"javascript:void(0)\">real estate property portal</a><!-- DYNAMIC: internal link -> route() -->.</p></div></div><div><span class=\"fi\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 20s-8-4.7-8-10a4.5 4.5 0 0 1 8-2.8A4.5 4.5 0 0 1 20 10c0 5.3-8 10-8 10z\"/></svg></span><div><h3>Healthcare</h3><p>Patient records, appointment management and operations portals with role-based access for clinical and admin staff. See: <a class=\"il\" href=\"javascript:void(0)\">healthcare management solution</a><!-- DYNAMIC: internal link -> route() -->.</p></div></div><div><span class=\"fi\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"20\" r=\"1.5\"/><circle cx=\"18\" cy=\"20\" r=\"1.5\"/><path d=\"M2 3h3l2.5 12h11.5l2-8H6.2\"/></svg></span><div><h3>E-commerce</h3><p>Multi-vendor platforms, order management, inventory control and storefront builders. See: <a class=\"il\" href=\"javascript:void(0)\">custom e-commerce platform</a><!-- DYNAMIC: internal link -> route() -->.</p></div></div><div><span class=\"fi\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"9\"/><path d=\"M15 9.5c-.5-1-1.6-1.5-3-1.5-1.7 0-3 .9-3 2s1.3 1.7 3 2 3 .9 3 2-1.3 2-3 2c-1.4 0-2.5-.5-3-1.5M12 6v2M12 16v2\"/></svg></span><div><h3>Fintech</h3><p>Payment processing, ledger management and financial reporting dashboards.</p></div></div><div><span class=\"fi\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"8\" r=\"4\"/><path d=\"M4 21a8 8 0 0 1 16 0\"/></svg></span><div><h3>HR &amp; Workforce</h3><p>Attendance, leave, payroll cycles and employee portals for teams running monthly cycles manually. See: <a class=\"il\" href=\"javascript:void(0)\">HRM &amp; payroll portal</a><!-- DYNAMIC: internal link -> route() -->.</p></div></div><div><span class=\"fi\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M2 6h12v10H2zM14 10h4l4 4v2h-8z\"/><circle cx=\"6\" cy=\"18\" r=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"18\" cy=\"18\" r=\"2\"/></svg></span><div><h3>Logistics &amp; Field Service</h3><p>Vendor management, job dispatch, SLA tracking and route operations. See: <a class=\"il\" href=\"javascript:void(0)\">ticketing CRM portal</a><!-- DYNAMIC: internal link -> route() -->.</p></div></div></div></div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"lsec rv \" id=\"process\" aria-labelledby=\"h-process\"><!-- DYNAMIC: $landing->sections[4] (steps) -->\n <div class=\"lw\"><p class=\"eyb\"><span>05 · Process</span></p><h2 id=\"h-process\">How I Run Projects: From Discovery to Production</h2><p class=\"lead nar\">Clear milestones reduce risk, especially when working with a remote developer in Pakistan for the first time. Every project follows the same four stages, whether the client is in Karachi or California.</p>\n <ol class=\"hsteps\" style=\"--n:4\"><li><span class=\"sn\">01</span><b>Discovery &amp; Audit</b><p>Map workflows, user roles, integrations and pain points before code. Define success metrics so scope stays realistic.</p></li><li><span class=\"sn\">02</span><b>Architecture</b><p>Database schema, API contracts, queue strategy, tenant model and security layers documented before development begins.</p></li><li><span class=\"sn\">03</span><b>Development &amp; QA</b><p>Focused sprints with Git, demos every one to two weeks, and QA on auth, payments, lead routing and API contracts before release.</p></li><li><span class=\"sn\">04</span><b>Deployment &amp; Handover</b><p>Production deploy with queues, cron, SSL and documentation. A full team walkthrough so your staff can operate the system after launch.</p></li></ol></div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"lsec rv \" id=\"stack\" aria-labelledby=\"h-stack\"><!-- DYNAMIC: $landing->sections[5] (stack) -->\n <div class=\"lw\"><p class=\"eyb\"><span>06 · Stack</span></p><h2 id=\"h-stack\">Technology Stack for Enterprise Software</h2><p class=\"lead nar\">I choose tools based on project load, maintainability and long-term upgrade paths, not framework trends.</p><div class=\"stk\"><div><b>Backend</b><span>PHP 8+, Laravel: strict typing, current LTS</span></div><div><b>Database</b><span>MySQL with indexing for CRM-scale data</span></div><div><b>Caching &amp; queues</b><span>Redis, Laravel Horizon for imports &amp; jobs</span></div><div><b>Authentication</b><span>Sanctum &amp; Passport for SPAs, mobile, partners</span></div><div><b>Frontend (web)</b><span>Blade, Vue.js, or API-only as needed</span></div><div><b>Mobile</b><span>Flutter / Dart, Firebase, Laravel API backends</span></div><div><b>Infrastructure</b><span>VPS or AWS, SSL, backups, zero-downtime deploys</span></div><div><b>Workflow</b><span>Git branching, documented handovers</span></div></div>\n <div class=\"lnote\"><p>Need deep Laravel specialization? <a class=\"il\" href=\"<?= base_url(\'/laravel-developer-karachi\') ?>\">Laravel developer in Karachi</a><!-- DYNAMIC: route(\'landing.show\', \'laravel\') -->. CRM-specific architecture? <a class=\"il\" href=\"<?= base_url(\'/crm-developers-pakistan\') ?>\">CRM developers in Pakistan</a><!-- DYNAMIC: route(\'landing.show\', \'crm\') -->.</p></div></div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"lsec rv tint\" id=\"local\" aria-labelledby=\"h-local\"><!-- DYNAMIC: $landing->sections[6] (local) -->\n <div class=\"lw\"><p class=\"eyb\"><span>07 · Why Karachi</span></p><h2 id=\"h-local\">Why Hire a Software Developer in Karachi</h2><p class=\"lead nar\">Karachi is Pakistan’s largest commercial city and one of South Asia’s most active technology hubs. For international clients, hiring a senior developer here delivers three practical advantages.</p><div class=\"loc\"><div><span class=\"fi\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 3 4 6v6c0 5 3.5 8 8 9 4.5-1 8-4 8-9V6z\"/><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"/></svg></span><h3>Cost-effective senior expertise</h3><p>Someone who has shipped multi-tenant CRMs, payroll systems and high-volume REST APIs, not a junior learning on your budget, at a fraction of equivalent US or UK agency rates.</p></div><div><span class=\"fi\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"9\"/><path d=\"M12 7v5l3 2\"/></svg></span><h3>Timezone compatibility</h3><p>Karachi (PKT, UTC+5) overlaps well with UAE, Saudi Arabia and European hours. US clients, particularly East Coast, get morning async overlap with end-of-day delivery, plus scheduled Zoom calls.</p></div><div><span class=\"fi\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 21s-7-6.2-7-11a7 7 0 0 1 14 0c0 4.8-7 11-7 11z\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"2.5\"/></svg></span><h3>Local and remote flexibility</h3><p>Karachi businesses can arrange on-site discovery and architecture sessions. International clients follow the same remote process via Slack, Zoom and GitHub.</p></div></div>\n <div class=\"lnote\"><p>See the full <a class=\"il\" href=\"javascript:void(0)\">services</a><!-- DYNAMIC: internal link -> route() --> portfolio, or read about <a class=\"il\" href=\"javascript:void(0)\">web development growth strategy</a><!-- DYNAMIC: internal link -> route() -->.</p></div></div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"lsec rv \" id=\"projects\" aria-labelledby=\"h-projects\"><!-- DYNAMIC: $landing->sections[7] (projects) -->\n <div class=\"lw\"><p class=\"eyb\"><span>08 · Proof</span></p><h2 id=\"h-projects\">Enterprise Projects Built for Real Business Load</h2><p class=\"lead nar\">Portfolio demos prove syntax. Production systems prove judgment. These builds run under real daily operational pressure.</p>\n <div class=\"prj\" style=\"--n:4\"><a class=\"pj\" href=\"javascript:void(0)\"><img src=\"<?= asset_url(\'images/banners/multi-tenant-crm.svg\') ?>\" alt=\"Multi-Tenant CRM case study banner\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1000\"><div><small>1.5M+ leads · 300+ users</small><h3>Multi-Tenant CRM</h3><p>Lead ingestion, assignment rules, tenant isolation and queue-driven imports: flagship proof for high-volume CRM architecture.</p><span>Read case study →</span></div></a><a class=\"pj\" href=\"javascript:void(0)\"><img src=\"<?= asset_url(\'images/banners/ticketing-crm.svg\') ?>\" alt=\"Ticketing CRM &amp; Vendor Portal case study banner\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1000\"><div><small>Jobs · SLA · vendor management</small><h3>Ticketing CRM &amp; Vendor Portal</h3><p>One portal replacing email chains and spreadsheets for field operations teams.</p><span>Read case study →</span></div></a><a class=\"pj\" href=\"javascript:void(0)\"><img src=\"<?= asset_url(\'images/banners/hrm-payroll.svg\') ?>\" alt=\"HRM &amp; Payroll Portal case study banner\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1000\"><div><small>Attendance · leave · payroll</small><h3>HRM &amp; Payroll Portal</h3><p>80% faster monthly processing with full audit history and employee self-service.</p><span>Read case study →</span></div></a><a class=\"pj\" href=\"javascript:void(0)\"><img src=\"<?= asset_url(\'images/banners/babyshop.svg\') ?>\" alt=\"Babyshop Mobile App case study banner\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1000\"><div><small>Flutter · Firebase · e-commerce</small><h3>Babyshop Mobile App</h3><p>Cross-platform mobile commerce with Laravel/Firebase backend integration.</p><span>Read case study →</span></div></a></div><!-- DYNAMIC: $landing->projects (route to case study) -->\n <div class=\"lnote\"><p><a class=\"il\" href=\"<?= base_url(\'/projects\') ?>\">Browse all 13 production projects →</a></p></div></div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"lsec rv \" id=\"faq\" aria-labelledby=\"h-faq\"><!-- DYNAMIC: $landing->sections[8] (faq) -->\n <div class=\"lw\"><p class=\"eyb\"><span>09 · FAQ</span></p><h2 id=\"h-faq\">Common Questions About Hiring a Developer in Karachi</h2><div class=\"fqw\"><details class=\"fq\" open><summary>How much does it cost to hire a developer in Karachi, Pakistan?<span class=\"pm\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></summary><div><p>Project cost depends entirely on scope and complexity. A focused CRM or internal tool MVP typically runs 4–8 weeks. Enterprise-scale multi-tenant CRM or SaaS builds with integrations, reporting and full documentation require a custom quote. Rates in Karachi are significantly more cost-effective than equivalent UK or US agencies while delivering senior-level architecture, not junior execution.</p></div></details><details class=\"fq\"><summary>Can I hire a remote developer in Karachi for a US or UK project?<span class=\"pm\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></summary><div><p><span class=\"ph\">[EDIT: answer, copy from live page]</span></p></div></details><details class=\"fq\"><summary>What is the difference between hiring here versus a platform freelancer?<span class=\"pm\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></summary><div><p><span class=\"ph\">[EDIT: answer, copy from live page]</span></p></div></details><details class=\"fq\"><summary>What tech stack do you use for enterprise software?<span class=\"pm\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></summary><div><p><span class=\"ph\">[EDIT: answer, copy from live page]</span></p></div></details><details class=\"fq\"><summary>Do you build mobile apps as well as web systems?<span class=\"pm\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></summary><div><p><span class=\"ph\">[EDIT: answer, copy from live page]</span></p></div></details><details class=\"fq\"><summary>Do you offer on-site consultations in Karachi?<span class=\"pm\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></summary><div><p><span class=\"ph\">[EDIT: answer, copy from live page]</span></p></div></details><details class=\"fq\"><summary>What industries do you specialize in?<span class=\"pm\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></summary><div><p><span class=\"ph\">[EDIT: answer, copy from live page]</span></p></div></details><details class=\"fq\"><summary>Will I own the source code after the project?<span class=\"pm\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></summary><div><p><span class=\"ph\">[EDIT: answer, copy from live page]</span></p></div></details></div></div>\n</section>\n<div class=\"wrap\">\n<section class=\"relp\"><p class=\"eyb\">Related pages</p><div class=\"rl\"><a href=\"<?= base_url(\'/laravel-developer-karachi\') ?>\"><b>Laravel Developer in Karachi</b><span>Audits, takeovers, performance and security.</span><i>→</i></a><a href=\"<?= base_url(\'/crm-developers-pakistan\') ?>\"><b>CRM Developers in Pakistan</b><span>Freelancer vs agency vs dedicated, cost &amp; timelines.</span><i>→</i></a><a href=\"<?= base_url(\'/services\') ?>\"><b>Services</b><span>Every service in one place.</span><i>→</i></a></div></section><!-- DYNAMIC: $landing->related -->\n<section class=\"cta\"><div><h2>Ready to build your next system?</h2><p>Tell me about your CRM, SaaS, automation, web application or Flutter app. I reply within 24 hours with an honest assessment of scope, timeline and approach, not a sales pitch. Project-based and long-term remote engagements, with on-site options for Karachi clients.</p></div><div class=\"bt2\"><a class=\"btn \" href=\"<?= base_url(\'/contact\') ?>\">Start your consultation →</a><a class=\"btn gw\" href=\"tel:+923196935307\">Call directly</a><a class=\"btn gw\" href=\"https://wa.me/[NUMBER]\">WhatsApp</a></div></section><!-- EDIT: Google reviews / WhatsApp URLs -->\n</div>','{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Home\", \"item\": \"https://[your-domain]/\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Full-Stack Developer in Karachi\", \"item\": \"https://[your-domain]/full-stack-developer-karachi\"}]}\n{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"ProfessionalService\", \"@id\": \"https://[your-domain]/full-stack-developer-karachi#service\", \"name\": \"Amaanullah Khan: Full-Stack Software Development\", \"url\": \"https://[your-domain]/full-stack-developer-karachi\", \"description\": \"Hire a senior full-stack developer in Karachi for custom CRM, SaaS platforms and business automation: Laravel backends, REST APIs, admin portals and Flutter mobile apps. On-site in Karachi, remote worldwide.\", \"telephone\": \"+92 319 6935307\", \"email\": \"info@amaanullah.com\", \"image\": \"https://[your-domain]/images/og/fullstack.webp\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Karachi\", \"addressRegion\": \"Sindh\", \"addressCountry\": \"PK\"}, \"areaServed\": [\"Karachi\", \"Pakistan\", \"US\", \"UK\", \"UAE\"], \"founder\": {\"@type\": \"Person\", \"name\": \"Amaanullah Khan\", \"jobTitle\": \"PHP & Laravel Developer\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Karachi\", \"addressCountry\": \"PK\"}}, \"aggregateRating\": {\"@type\": \"AggregateRating\", \"ratingValue\": \"4.8\", \"reviewCount\": \"27\"}}\n{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How much does it cost to hire a developer in Karachi, Pakistan?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Project cost depends entirely on scope and complexity. A focused CRM or internal tool MVP typically runs 4–8 weeks. Enterprise-scale multi-tenant CRM or SaaS builds with integrations, reporting and full documentation require a custom quote. Rates in Karachi are significantly more cost-effective than equivalent UK or US agencies while delivering senior-level architecture, not junior execution.\"}}]}',1,880,'2026-10-23 05:07:05','2026-10-27 03:09:51');
